  kc-core shapes: HTTP 201

Step 2.2: [Schema] Loading ontology package [mtg-domain] (2 of 2)...
  Package: MTG Color Philosophy Domain Extension
  Depends on: kc-core
  Classes: Color (-> Vertex), ColorPair (-> Edge), ColorTriple (-> Face)
  Properties: guild, theme, persona, goal, method, ... (14 domain properties)
  Shapes: ColorShape, ColorPairShape, ColorTripleShape
  mtg-domain ontology: HTTP 201
  mtg-domain shapes: HTTP 201

Step 2.3: [Schema] Package loading summary
  2 ontology packages loaded (kc-core + mtg-domain)
  6 SHACL shapes active (3 core + 3 domain)
  Note: storage treats ontology triples identically to data triples.
  Schema interpretation is an external concern — the quadstore is indifferent.

